1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
My soul yearns for a soul like my own.

2
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:07,600
In this crowded world, that might be the hardest thing to find.

3
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:14,180
Someone who carries a heart full of understanding and still knows what it means to feel alone.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,300
Someone who understands the way I love.
